    <description>WS8 fan-out orchestrator variant 3 (ADR D61): the supplier-disruption scenario orchestrated from Agentforce, authored in Agent Script. The third point on the who-owns-concurrency axis (host / graph / serial-Apex). Runs two topologies picked per run via an [A2A-LAB ROUTING] fanout-topology block — DELEGATED (one Apex callout to the bridge&apos;s fanout: route, which runs the three legs in parallel off-platform) or SERIAL (three stacked Apex callouts, which a real three-leg run overruns by design). Reuses the A2ALabInvokeRemoteAgent invocable; no new Apex.</description>
